 cone, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{0}^{2}}{4}+\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9} & ={z}^{2} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{9} & ={z}^{2} \\\\ z & =\\pm \\frac{y}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us two lines in the $yz$-plane with equations $z=\\pm \\frac{y}{3}.$" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316776 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316777 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316778 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316779 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1000 #edb/ref 17592186316780 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1041 "selection" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1104 #edb/ref 17592186316776 13194139534876 true] [17592186316775 1110 #uuid "c5fa9f76-fa14-5642-b2f2-2a3609a1b5c5" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316776 1034 "z=\\pm \\frac{y}{3}" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316776 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534876 true] [17592186316776 1111 #uuid "2bcab5e5-4bc7-5832-80ce-3868ed6012c6" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316777 1034 "z=-\\frac{y}{3}" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316777 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534876 true] [17592186316777 1111 #uuid "e66722e2-4447-58b6-b28a-6513edf71490" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316778 1034 "z=\\pm \\frac{y}{9}" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316778 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534876 true] [17592186316778 1111 #uuid "9354c474-e593-5dc5-88a5-b62bae7ac79c" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316779 1034 "z=\\pm \\frac{y}{9}+1" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316779 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534876 true] [17592186316779 1111 #uuid "b58d23c4-5e30-5306-8529-4cdd4556b110" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316780 1034 "z=-\\frac{y}{3}\\pm 1" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316780 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534876 true] [17592186316780 1111 #uuid "3a252632-dc8a-5ba2-95ab-6e022446003c" 13194139534876 true] [17592186316781 1017 #edb/ref 17592